{"story":{"id":"event-first-contact-critters-85","title":{"zh":"活的星际碎片？","en":"Living Space Debris?"},"category":"society","kind":"family","image":"art/0bc19a1f57c856b531b4.webp","start":"first_contact_critters.80","chapters":4,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"我们之前用[This.ContactCountry.GetName]指称的不规则物体可能是一种有机生物，[This.Owner.GetEnvoyCap][This.Leader.GetName]仍在努力验证这一假说。尽管它看起来就是一些随机的星际物质组成的团簇，但毋庸置疑地它们可以在虚空中推进，并展现出了一定程度的自主智能。我们的[This.Owner.GetResearchers]为这种现象困惑，并正在努力验证获得的数据。","en":"[This.Owner.GetEnvoyCap] [This.Leader.GetName] is still working to confirm the hypothesis that the irregularity we had designated as [This.ContactCountry.GetName] is in fact a living organism. While it seems to be made up of a cluster of random star dust, it i"},"review":{"status":"reviewed","date":"2026-10-13","reviewer":"c7b-society (resumed)","scope":{"zh":"虚空云首次接触：2个事件、1个项目与结果事件。","en":"Void-cloud first contact: 2 events, 1 project and its result."},"sources":["events/first_contact_NPC_country_types_events.txt:1070-1163","common/first_contact/01_first_contact_space_fauna_and_NPCs.txt:373-411","common/special_projects/00_projects_2.txt:578-594"],"uncertain":[],"guide":"public/summaries/event-first-contact-critters-85.md"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"first_contact_critters.80","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"first_contact_critters.85","parent":"n1","via":{"kind":"bridge","label":{"zh":"遭遇进入下一阶段（难度3）","en":"The encounter's next stage (difficulty 3)"},"conditional":true,"source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-critters-85.json","optionIndex":0,"option":"first_contact_critters.80.A"},"children":["n3","n4"]},"n3":{"doc":"special_projects:CLOUDS_PROJECT","parent":"n2","via":{"option":"story.401.a.spiri","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_NPC_country_types_events.txt:1134"},"children":["n5"]},"n4":{"ref":"n3","doc":"special_projects:CLOUDS_PROJECT","parent":"n2","via":{"option":"story.401.c","optionIndex":1,"kind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_NPC_country_types_events.txt:1149"}},"n5":{"doc":"story.405","parent":"n3","via":{"hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_2.txt:589"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact_critters.80","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"活的星际碎片？","en":"Living Space Debris?"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们之前用[This.ContactCountry.GetName]指称的不规则物体可能是一种有机生物，[This.Owner.GetEnvoyCap][This.Leader.GetName]仍在努力验证这一假说。尽管它看起来就是一些随机的星际物质组成的团簇，但毋庸置疑地它们可以在虚空中推进，并展现出了一定程度的自主智能。我们的[This.Owner.GetResearchers]为这种现象困惑，并正在努力验证获得的数据。","en":"[This.Owner.GetEnvoyCap] [This.Leader.GetName] is still working to confirm the hypothesis that the irregularity we had designated as [This.ContactCountry.GetName] is in fact a living organism. While it seems to be made up of a cluster of random star dust, it is demonstrably able to propel itself across the void and shows basic signs of independent agency. Our [This.Owner.GetResearchers] are perplexed by the phenomenon, and are working hard to verify our readings."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/0bc19a1f57c856b531b4.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"first_contact_critters.80.A","label":{"zh":"我们一定搞错了什么……","en":"We must be missing something..."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"first_contact_critters.85","kind":"bridge","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"bridge","source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-critters-85.json","label":{"zh":"遭遇进入下一阶段（难度3）","en":"The encounter's next stage (difficulty 3)"},"story":"event-first-contact-critters-85"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/first_contact_NPC_country_types_events.txt","line":1069},"names":{"This.ContactCountry.GetName":{"zh":"未知天体","en":"an unknown object","note":{"zh":"游戏里这里会出现这个天体的暂用名称。","en":"In the game, the provisional designation of this object appears here."}},"This.Leader.GetName":{"zh":"这位领袖","en":"the leader","note":{"zh":"游戏里这里会出现这位人物的名字。","en":"In the game, the character's name appears here."}}}},{"id":"first_contact_critters.85","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"虚空之云","en":"Void Clouds"},"texts":[{"zh":"一项对此前以[This.ContactCountry.GetName]指代的一堆残骸和太空尘埃的调查居然得到了惊人的发现：它是一团由微粒聚集而成的云体，蕴含着来源不明的强大能源。它原本连反射性动作都不应该做出，更不要说是自主移动了。\n\n可它确实在自主移动。\n\n这份录像中移动的飘渺物体透着一股不祥之兆，或许这个宇宙里有一些东西是我们不该去碰的。","en":"Our investigation into the peculiar cluster of debris and space-dust with the designation [This.ContactCountry.GetName] has yielded surprising results: it is a particulate cloud bristling with a powerful charge of unknown origin. It has no business exhibiting simple reflexive actions, let alone movements with purpose.\n\nAnd yet it does.\n\nThere is something undeniably ominous about the hazy subject of the relayed video feeds. Perhaps there are things in the universe we should not tangle with."},{"zh":"“如云，”一份从多个材料整合出来的报道上写着，“如云般的光辉星辰在暗潮中汹涌”。这份报告描述的极具诗意的现象是“虚空之云”。\n\n对于[Root.Owner.GetName]的祭司来说，这些星云是被某种更伟大的意志所驱动的信使，目前没有人知道在背后操控虚空之云的到底是谁或是什么，在确定虚空之云的来龙去脉之前，还是不要轻举妄动为好。","en":"\"A cloud,\" reads the awed report, collated from multiple sources. \"Like a cloud of luminous star-stuff, billowing in the dark.\" The report goes on to refer to the phenomenon, somewhat poetically, as a \"void cloud.\"\n\nIt is evident to the priesthoods of the [Root.Owner.GetName] that these clouds are heralds animated by some higher will. Exactly who or what this will belongs is the subject of heated debate, and is likely to remain so for the foreseeable future. Until such time as the Void Cloud's true nature can be ascertained, it would perhaps be prudent to treat the immense power evident in its roiling motion with some caution."},{"zh":"一项对此前以[This.ContactCountry.GetName]为代称的一堆残骸和太空尘埃的调查居然得到了惊人的发现：微粒聚集而成的云体，散发着未知的强大能源，它原本连反射性动作都不应该做出，更不要说是自主移动了。\n\n但它确实在自主地移动着。\n\n这份录像中移动的飘渺物体透着一股不祥之兆，或许这个宇宙里有一些东西是我们不该去碰的。","en":"An investigation into a peculiar cluster of debris and space-dust previously dubbed [This.ContactCountry.GetName] has yielded surprising results; it is a particulate cloud bristling with a powerful charge of unknown origin that has no business exhibiting simple reflexive actions, let alone movements with purpose.\n\nAnd yet it does.\n\nThere is something undeniably ominous about the hazy subject of the relayed video feeds. Perhaps there are things in the universe we should not tangle with."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/8bc7425b2007b2c2149c.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"story.401.a.spiri","label":{"zh":"不管它是不是与神灵有关的媒介，我们都要研究它。","en":"Conduit for the divine or not, it must be studied."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"special_projects:CLOUDS_PROJECT","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_NPC_country_types_events.txt:1134","story":"event-first-contact-critters-85"},{"target":"galactic_features.387","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c1","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"tiyanki_graveyard_survey","path":"","value":true}]]],"source":"common/scripted_effects/first_contact_effects.txt:178","story":"event-galactic-features-387"},{"target":"cara.1020","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c1","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"any_country","arg":"{…}","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"exists","arg":"event_target:caravaneer_fleet1_country","scope":"","value":true},{"type":"other","key